---
description: API changes must preserve the declared contract and consumer compatibility
globs:
  - "routes/**"
  - "app/**"
  - "src/**"
  - "docs/api/**"
  - "**/openapi.*"
  - "**/swagger.*"
---

For API changes:
- update contract with implementation
- do not silently change response shapes
- review breaking changes
- preserve consistent auth/errors/pagination
- regenerate typed clients when contract changes
- run contract checks and consumer typecheck
